omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8_7vnJkZ3M4Q7kNvwHFfXKE&_nc_oc=AdqRRuwgToZr0OA6_UdZy4m4ExdSpUOjnJhB1e-lMuQMGvmu5PQO4EKoeW6d_4II2BY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPhwJIvtMKmNxm3ULXY7cNP_3v-mugLmoRk8QO0IFI77g&oe=6AE607B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XFqYjydrU7gQ7kNvwGO3dZP&_nc_oc=AdqL9NoMAs_enK7homWDi5_JTwNkO9dDjR-7Xtv8OSIrSG_3alhac4AtS_G9ZFBUQTs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNXseT3-Bjxy2hYcK5C-NtBFMuLEgyL1vDMjjihb_w0rA&oe=6AE60916"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QcemQK9nZhUQ7kNvwF3Xco-&_nc_oc=AdqtOdkB7aHYsrG_d-4odWuiWBudKbQsJngAXsxgU67mNzIFvICEqMICpKPu9c1-Gc0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNPZ__gYnF1FSd2vM_MQZ5ZeKNCG9axF4SvT0MW74gqaA&oe=6AE5E5F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://